## libheif — GNU Lesser General Public License v3.0 (LGPL-3.0)

This file distribution includes a WebAssembly build of libheif (compiled and
embedded inside heic2any.min.js). libheif is licensed under the GNU Lesser
General Public License v3.0.

The full LGPL-3.0 license text is available at:
https://www.gnu.org/licenses/lgpl-3.0.html
Source: https://github.com/strukturag/libheif

Moteful uses this library solely as a client-side (in-browser) decoder for the
HEIC input format. No server-side distribution or modification of the library
is performed; the unmodified upstream build is embedded as-is for privacy-first
local decoding, per LGPL-3.0 Section 4 requirements.
